This directory is used by the `blog-article-writer` skill and commands.
It serves as a workspace for creating new blog articles, including:

- Research notes (prime step)
- Article plans
- Draft content
- Validation checks

The `blog-article-writer` skill uses this location to store intermediate files during the article creation workflow.
